<title>GERMANY: SGZ Bank keeps 96 dividend steady.</title>
<headline>SGZ Bank keeps 96 dividend steady.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend				     10	vs 10 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend sum				 36	vs 33</p>
<p>    Addition to reserves			7	vs 34</p>
<p>    Net profits for the year		 43	vs 67</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Suedwestdeutsche Genossenschafts Zentralbank AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
